Dataset work follows `heavymap-planning/DATASET-ROUTINE.md` (a living DRAFT; if a skill or rule disagrees, the doc wins). Do not rewrite routine docs unless the issue asks for it; propose changes in the PR. CSV edits: UTF-8, LF, RFC-4180, ISO dates, text IDs, no formula-leading cells, multiple values separated by ` | ` (see `HARD-RULES.md`). After touching `Spreadsheets/00-PLANNING-INDEX.csv` run `python3 scripts/check_index_paths.py`. Never edit the MCS outside its process (`AGENTS-MCS.md`). Atlas process insights go in `Spreadsheets/19-process-insights.csv`. Frontend insights follow `heavymap-planning/WORKING-AGREEMENT.md` (HM-PI prefix, interim PR-report route). Keep the same columns and append-only etiquette.
